#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:111
msgid "(daed is not running)"
msgstr "（daed 未运行）"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:153
msgid ""
"Address and port of the dashboard and GraphQL API, for example "
"<code>0.0.0.0:2023</code>. The WAN zone rejects it; create the admin account "
"right after the first start, because the first visitor creates it."
msgstr ""
"仪表盘和 GraphQL API 的监听地址和端口，例如 <code>0.0.0.0:2023</code>。WAN 区"
"域会拒绝访问；首次启动后请立即创建管理员账户，因为第一个访问者会创建该账户。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:197
msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "仪表盘"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:152
msgid "Dashboard address"
msgstr "仪表盘地址"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:148
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-daed.json:3
msgid "Enable, configure and inspect daed"
msgstr "启用、配置和查看 daed"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:157
msgid "Expecting host:port, [IPv6]:port or :port"
msgstr "格式应为 host:port、[IPv6]:port 或 :port"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:169
msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "正在加载…"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:203
msgid "Log"
msgstr "日志"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:160
msgid "Log size (MB)"
msgstr "日志大小 (MB)"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:78
msgid "No log yet."
msgstr "暂无日志。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:106
msgid "Open dashboard"
msgstr "打开仪表盘"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:209
msgid "Refresh log"
msgstr "刷新日志"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:175
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重启"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:124
msgid "Restart failed: %s"
msgstr "重启失败：%s"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:161
msgid "Rotate /var/log/daed/daed.log at this size. The log is kept in RAM."
msgstr "/var/log/daed/daed.log 达到此大小时轮转。日志保存在内存中。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:165
msgid "Rotated logs kept"
msgstr "保留的轮转日志数"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:145
msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:149
msgid ""
"Start daed now and at boot. daed and Passwall both intercept forwarded "
"traffic, so daed does not start while Passwall is enabled."
msgstr ""
"立即并在开机时启动 daed。daed 和 Passwall 都会拦截转发流量，因此启用 "
"Passwall 时 daed 不会启动。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:194
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:98
msgid ""
"The dashboard listens on loopback only; it is not reachable from this "
"browser."
msgstr "仪表盘仅监听回环地址，无法从此浏览器访问。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:80
msgid "Unable to read the log: %s"
msgstr "无法读取日志：%s"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:142
#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-daed.json:3
msgid "daed"
msgstr "daed"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:64
msgid "daed is disabled."
msgstr "daed 已停用。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:61
msgid ""
"daed is enabled but not running because Passwall is enabled. daed refuses to "
"run alongside Passwall; disable Passwall first."
msgstr ""
"daed 已启用但未运行，因为 Passwall 已启用。daed 不会与 Passwall 同时运行；请"
"先停用 Passwall。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:63
msgid "daed is enabled but not running. Check the log below."
msgstr "daed 已启用但未运行。请查看下方日志。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:59
msgid "daed is running."
msgstr "daed 正在运行。"

#: package/custom/luci-app-daed/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/daed/settings.js:143
msgid ""
"daed is the dae eBPF transparent proxy with its own web dashboard. Nodes, "
"groups, routing and DNS are configured in the dashboard; this page only "
"controls the service."
msgstr ""
"daed 是带有自己网页仪表盘的 dae eBPF 透明代理。节点、分组、路由和 DNS 在仪表"
"盘中配置；此页面只控制服务。"
